<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0C0E11 0%, #1B2026 65%, #0C0E11 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#A9D3C9;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Instrument Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Land Surveying in Adelaide's Western Suburbs</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Charles Sturt, West Torrens and the western part of Port Adelaide Enfield make up the Adelaide West region of the state's regional plan, where most recent new homes have come from small scale infill. Work out which survey you need, then talk to an independent Licensed Surveyor.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+61855503814" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (08) 5550 3814</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Written Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/city-5.webp" alt="Land Surveying in Adelaide's Western Suburbs" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
